        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF08-TLTGR, Light Turquoise Acrylic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Light Turquoise Acrylic Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. The Pacific Series 8 Colored Acrylic Handle is treated with UV inhibitors, so you can be sure that it won't discolor with time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First impressions Light Green Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" align=\"right\"border=\"0\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door pulls are hand waxed with butcher's wax to add longevity to the life of the finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08012ATLTGR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08024ATLTGR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF08036ATLTGR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable</b> and has an <b>Extended Lead-Time</b>. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Light Turquoise Door Pull",
                "description": "The Light Turquoise Acrylic Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting on wood, glass, or metal doors. The Pacific Series 8 Colored Acrylic Handle is treated with UV inhibitors, so you can be sure that it won't discolor with time.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Pacific Series 8 Light Green Acrylic Handles, Light Turquoise Door Pulls, First Impressions PCF08-TLTGR, FII-PCF08-TLTGR, Pacific collection series 8, 1 inch diameter acrylic door pulls, light green acrylic door pulls, Colored Acrylic Door Handles, commercial door pulls for beach hotels, beach themed door pulls, modern ocean front door pulls, Miami Beach Light Turquoise Door Pulls,"
